---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Map" seoTitle="Farmington Canal & Hampshire & Hampden Canal Map" description="Explore the historic Farmington Canal and Hampshire & Hampden Canal with an interactive map, Lidar imagery, town histories, and surviving canal features." wide>
  <script slot="head" is:inline type="module" src="https://js.arcgis.com/embeddable-components/4.32/arcgis-embeddable-components.esm.js"></script>
  <figure class="hero-image">
    <a href="/img/maps/Aqueduct-Hillside.png"><img src="/img/maps/Aqueduct-Hillside.png" alt="Farmington River aqueduct and feeder canal" fetchpriority="high" /></a>
    <figcaption>Farmington River aqueduct and feeder canal</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="prose intro">
    <h1>Map of the New Haven &amp; Northampton Canal</h1>
    <p class="lead">Farmington Canal | Hampshire &amp; Hampden Canal</p>
    <p>Trace the historic canal from New Haven, Connecticut, to Northampton, Massachusetts, and explore what remains today. <a href="/about">How the map was made</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <nav class="external-maps" aria-label="External maps">
    <span>Open the map</span>
    <a class="button-link" href="https://www.arcgis.com/apps/mapviewer/index.html?webmap=3938e2b4321d41879d64de09d1238864">ArcGIS Map Viewer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="button-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=1Nmc9hdgXUj_rYjzSdlo672LayyNMGZw&usp=sharing">Google My Maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </nav>
  <div class="map-frame arcgis-frame" aria-label="Interactive canal map">
    <arcgis-embedded-map
      item-id="3938e2b4321d41879d64de09d1238864"
      theme="dark"
      bookmarks-enabled
      heading-enabled
      legend-enabled
      information-enabled
      share-enabled
      portal-url="https://www.arcgis.com"
    ></arcgis-embedded-map>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>The interactive map requires JavaScript. Use the external map links above to view it.</p></noscript>
  <div class="prose intro">
    <aside class="callout"><strong>A work in progress.</strong> Data is currently available as vector lines and points of interest, including feeder canals. It does not account for dimensions of the canal, basins, or sections.</aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .external-maps { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .external-maps > span { font-weight: 600; margin-right: .25rem; }
  .external-maps .button-link { border-color: var(--accent); padding: .65rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .external-maps .button-link:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .external-maps > span { flex-basis: 100%; }
  }
</style>
